674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yQRSWh7TluQQ7kNvwG2XugD&_nc_oc=AdreLtAHgmZe6EYnV_kalmmd8qfs0P1qQ88nf4uX4nMPB5sX4-kpg4u1hroF72zudXw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQDyUJSOR5fL2oyfOLtW1wlkVkP5tTsusg5xp4bFBMnqw&oe=6AF47C59"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CIhcUMuQkJwQ7kNvwFPFdAJ&_nc_oc=Adq5Q-Pih3CmUsslHO4mmZLnia3u_BZCHWorYqw0-ygomjfbiln6_lXgEWGGlDTLznM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSLaEJvIdaGPXw83Ktx0N6MNhhIyIjRptV6ijC57gC22w&oe=6AF48516"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8ouJCdYlATcQ7kNvwFGT4IS&_nc_oc=Adrotg1yDlinjIAFHLh8dS350H7Zykhl6zGjMicy3Lj9vYYRxD40Qmdglep0tOTk4bo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQZ_lOuo2sTYWy945qNJQ4QBB9TNQO8M0L0MtOTUyy_yQ&oe=6AF48131"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip